00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:01.670 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  developing out of california tonight  three people are dead and 27  others were rescued from the water after  a boat overturned off the coast of san  diego  video shows waves battering the vessel  as it drifts in  you can see the boat tipped sideways  there people aboard try to climb to the  other side of the railing  as others are tossed overboard life  jackets and debris are scattered  throughout the water the boat eventually  breaks into pieces  border patrol agents say this was a  human smuggling situation  so every indication from our perspective  is that this was a smuggling vessel  used to smuggle migrants into the united  states legally we haven't confirmed the  nationality  of the people involved but our agents  are with many of  the hospital and the man who we  believe was the operator agents are with  them and a suspected  smuggler but the investigation is still  unfolding  officials say they have seen an increase  in smuggler boats within the last few  years they haven't confirmed if any  miners were involved in this particular  operation  the captain of the boat is now in  custody

